          { "offset": 1, "hex": "cb 55 ac 38" },
          { "offset": 5, "hex": "03" }
        ],
        "reads": 1,
        "returns_canned_reply": true
      },
      "note": "canned_reply is a fixture from FakeStatusBus, not a capture from a panel. The byte checks describe the single write; the reference tail defaults to 03."
